<figure class="dimension-figure" aria-labelledby="dimension-caption">
  <figcaption id="dimension-caption">
    <span class="mono">FIG 06</span>
    <p><strong>Join reference facts. Derive temporal facts.</strong> A dimension describes a thing; the activity stream preserves what happened to it.</p>
  </figcaption>
  <div class="diagram-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 760 352" role="img" aria-labelledby="dimension-title dimension-desc">
      <title id="dimension-title">Boundary between the activity stream and dimensions</title>
      <desc id="dimension-desc">The activity stream contains event history and joins when needed to SKU, customer, and geography dimensions. A first UTM source field is shown outside the dimension boundary because it should be derived from event history.</desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id="dimension-arrow" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 8 4 0 8Z" fill="#167e6c"></path></marker>
      </defs>
      <text class="column-label" x="32" y="28">EVENT HISTORY</text>
      <text class="column-label" x="486" y="28">REFERENCE FACTS</text>
      <g class="joins" marker-end="url(#dimension-arrow)">
        <path d="M306 156 H390 Q404 156 404 142 V90 H474"></path>
        <path d="M306 176 H474"></path>
        <path d="M306 196 H390 Q404 196 404 210 V262 H474"></path>
      </g>
      <g class="stream-node">
        <rect x="32" y="74" width="274" height="148"></rect>
        <text class="tag" x="52" y="100">PRIMARY MODELED LAYER</text>
        <text class="title" x="52" y="134">Activity stream</text>
        <text class="field" x="52" y="166">customer · ts · activity</text>
        <text class="field" x="52" y="186">features · revenue impact</text>
        <text class="note" x="52" y="210">immutable history of what happened</text>
      </g>
      <g class="dimension-node">
        <rect x="474" y="58" width="250" height="64"></rect>
        <text class="tag" x="492" y="80">SKU DIMENSION</text><text class="field" x="492" y="102">product name · category · hierarchy</text>
        <rect x="474" y="144" width="250" height="64"></rect>
        <text class="tag" x="492" y="166">CUSTOMER REFERENCE</text><text class="field" x="492" y="188">current attributes · identity mapping</text>
        <rect x="474" y="230" width="250" height="64"></rect>
        <text class="tag" x="492" y="252">GEOGRAPHY</text><text class="field" x="492" y="274">country · region · currency</text>
      </g>
      <text class="join-label" x="390" y="168" text-anchor="middle">JOIN WHEN NEEDED</text>
      <g class="excluded">
        <path d="M32 302 H724"></path>
        <text class="stop" x="32" y="332">×</text>
        <text class="field" x="54" y="330">first_utm_source</text>
        <text class="reason" x="218" y="330">depends on “first” → derive from activities, do not freeze in a dimension</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
</figure>

